WEBVTT

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:10.530
It has been one year since Sir Rio 
and Latifa came to our village.

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:16.030
I'm sure everyone is aware of how much 
the two of them have done for us here.

00:00:16.030 --> 00:00:18.970
So on this fine day of 
the Grand Spirit Festival,

00:00:18.970 --> 00:00:22.040
with the kiss of blessing from Lady Dryas,

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:24.630
Sir Rio is hereby welcomed as our sworn friend,

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:29.630
and Latifa as a resident of our village.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:45.850
I'm going to continue to 
count on the both of you.

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:46.650
Yes, milady!

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:47.280
Y-Yes, milady!

00:00:49.770 --> 00:00:52.770
Now, that's the end of the ceremony.

00:00:52.770 --> 00:00:55.030
Everyone! It's time to feast!

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:57.030
Yeah!

00:01:13.050 --> 00:01:16.220
Seirei Gensouki

00:01:13.050 --> 00:01:16.220
Seirei Gensouki

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:32.500
<b>Festival Night</b>

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:32.500
<b>Festival Night</b>

00:02:35.390 --> 00:02:36.510
<i>How...</i>

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:38.080
<i>did things turn out like this?</i>

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:41.070
Mashter Rio, are you enjoying yourshelf?

00:02:41.070 --> 00:02:44.010
Miss Orphia, perhaps you 
should refrain a little...

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:49.680
Oh, how long're you gonna 
shpeak sho formally with ush?

00:02:49.680 --> 00:02:50.310
What?

00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:53.980
It'sh already been a year shince 
we met. It'sh unforgivable!

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:57.550
Orphia, don't be ridiculous. 
Master Rio is right.

00:02:57.550 --> 00:02:58.950
Miss Sara...

00:02:58.950 --> 00:03:01.220
Clinging to him like this is just...

00:03:01.220 --> 00:03:04.620
Sara, I think you might be drunk yourself.

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:06.510
Yes, just a little.

00:03:06.510 --> 00:03:08.920
<i>It's not just a little. I'm certain of it.</i>

00:03:08.920 --> 00:03:12.450
Big Sis Orphia! Big Sis Sara! That's no fair!

00:03:12.860 --> 00:03:15.000
L-Latifa! I can't breathe!

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:19.720
Big Sister Sara, Big Sister Orphia... 
Master Rio looks to be at a loss.

00:03:19.980 --> 00:03:22.530
I know you want to deepen your 
friendship with Master Rio,

00:03:22.530 --> 00:03:25.220
but you're causing him problems instead.

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:27.620
Deepen their friendship with me?

00:03:27.620 --> 00:03:32.790
That'sh right! I wanna be 
friendlier with you, Mashter Rio!

00:03:32.790 --> 00:03:35.230
We live together, don't we?

00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:37.850
B-But... How can I put this...

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:41.240
Latifa treats us as her older sisters,

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:44.110
but it feels like you keep your 
distance from us, Master Rio.

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:48.260
And even now, when you've 
become our sworn friend...

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:50.990
Thank you.

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:55.080
I'm not very good at being social, but...

00:03:55.610 --> 00:03:59.130
if you'd let me be better friends 
with you, it would make me very happy.

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:01.760
O-Of course! We'd be delighted!

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:03.760
Please, think well of us!

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:05.260
Yay!

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:09.110
Now we can get along even better 
with everyone than we did before!

00:04:09.110 --> 00:04:10.270
Yes.

00:04:10.490 --> 00:04:13.710
Well, if we're going to 
exchange cups of friendship,

00:04:13.710 --> 00:04:16.480
I'm going to go get more to drink!

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:16.480
What? No, I think...

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:18.420
It would be better if we didn't!

00:04:18.420 --> 00:04:20.440
I'm gonna go bring shome.

00:04:20.440 --> 00:04:22.950
The both of you are getting tipsy. I'll go.

00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:25.350
I'll go, too!

00:04:26.230 --> 00:04:28.060
She seems to be having fun.

00:04:29.590 --> 00:04:30.880
Mistress Ursula...

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:33.820
Yes. She has a lovely smile.

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:38.790
She has become an integral
part of our village.

00:04:39.390 --> 00:04:43.120
I'm... thinking I should tell Latifa soon.

00:04:43.120 --> 00:04:44.740
So you are going, then?

00:04:44.740 --> 00:04:45.470
Yes.

00:04:45.990 --> 00:04:47.980
She is sure to miss you.

00:04:48.550 --> 00:04:49.950
I see.

00:04:49.950 --> 00:04:52.310
I feel it is a little too soon,

00:04:52.920 --> 00:04:55.300
but perhaps it is the right time.

00:04:57.990 --> 00:05:02.820
Tonight, we shall rest here. We'll depart 
for Strahl early tomorrow morning.

00:05:03.630 --> 00:05:06.750
I'm going to investigate the area a little.

00:05:07.250 --> 00:05:09.360
Please, look after the griffin.

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:10.580
What? But...

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:12.570
Here. Just in case.

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:15.480
It's a type of artifact.

00:05:15.480 --> 00:05:18.330
Protection, in the event the worst happens.

00:05:18.770 --> 00:05:22.750
If you swallow this, I will 
be able to tell where you are.

00:05:23.960 --> 00:05:25.530
I-I see.

00:05:26.980 --> 00:05:28.220
If anything happens,

00:05:28.630 --> 00:05:31.290
don't worry about me. 
Use the griffin to escape.

00:05:31.290 --> 00:05:34.700
If you head in that direction, 
it will be easier for me to find you.

00:05:36.690 --> 00:05:39.710
Please, take very good care of the egg.

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:50.990
It's just about time for you to 
come after the egg, I believe.

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:55.540
And I see you've made your appearance.

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:59.390
I do hope my lure plays his role to his utmost.

00:06:14.420 --> 00:06:16.780
What's wrong, Onii-chan?

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:20.750
You asked me to go on a walk, but you 
haven't said anything this whole time.

00:06:20.750 --> 00:06:21.610
Sorry.

00:06:21.840 --> 00:06:23.950
Let's go back to the plaza!

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:27.450
There's still lots of food and drink left!

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:28.400
Latifa...

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:29.860
What is it?

00:06:30.650 --> 00:06:33.490
Do you enjoy living here?

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:36.370
Yes! It's really fun!

00:06:36.650 --> 00:06:38.800
Big Sis Sara and the others are here.

00:06:38.800 --> 00:06:41.230
And Mistress Ursula and the 
others are really nice.

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:43.830
And... you're here, Onii-chan!

00:06:47.350 --> 00:06:48.180
I see.

00:06:48.180 --> 00:06:48.990
Yup!

00:06:49.440 --> 00:06:50.800
Latifa.

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:54.830
After a little while, I...

00:06:55.750 --> 00:06:58.930
I'm... going to leave the village.

00:06:59.390 --> 00:07:00.170
What?

00:07:04.350 --> 00:07:05.130
No.

00:07:05.130 --> 00:07:08.690
You know that I was originally 
headed to the east, right?

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:10.680
I'm going with you.

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:12.430
I can't take you with me.

00:07:12.430 --> 00:07:13.310
Why not?

00:07:13.310 --> 00:07:17.200
I'm going somewhere I've never 
been before. I don't know the dangers.

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:20.790
No! I don't want to be apart from you, ever!

00:07:21.300 --> 00:07:22.520
Latifa...

00:07:22.520 --> 00:07:23.870
I don't want to hear it!

00:07:23.870 --> 00:07:25.020
Latifa!

00:07:33.450 --> 00:07:35.310
A reaction inside the barrier?

00:07:35.310 --> 00:07:38.670
Yes. Lady Dryas noticed it, too.

00:07:38.670 --> 00:07:41.060
It seems it isn't simply one or two.

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:42.810
I will go confirm it immediately.

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:44.760
Take warriors with you.

00:07:44.760 --> 00:07:45.570
Yes, Eldest.

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:02.750
It seems everyone went, 
leaving no one behind.

00:08:03.450 --> 00:08:06.030
Your faculties of pursuit are impressive,

00:08:06.030 --> 00:08:08.750
but it seems your intelligence 
is somewhat lacking.

00:08:10.240 --> 00:08:13.680
Thanks to that, I can take 
my time acquiring these.

00:08:27.710 --> 00:08:30.610
Sara, I'm detecting suspicious od reactions.

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:31.800
Location?

00:08:32.840 --> 00:08:34.460
Two at that spring.

00:08:35.500 --> 00:08:37.050
There's a human!

00:08:37.050 --> 00:08:38.280
And...

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:39.520
A griffin!

00:08:40.360 --> 00:08:44.000
Be careful that we're not the ones 
to initiate combat. Understood?

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:45.090
Understood!

00:08:51.690 --> 00:08:53.010
Master Reiss—

00:08:53.910 --> 00:08:55.050
Demi-humans!

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:58.270
Will you come quietly and do as we say?

00:08:58.270 --> 00:09:00.890
What are you doing here at this time of day?

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:03.890
Is that... What kind of egg is that?

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:06.540
Th-This is, um...

00:09:06.540 --> 00:09:08.090
Please, answer us.

00:09:14.760 --> 00:09:15.740
Halt!

00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:17.110
Go!

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:21.540
Lady Sara, permission to attack?

00:09:22.890 --> 00:09:26.000
It seems it's unavoidable. 
Target the griffin!

00:09:34.540 --> 00:09:35.590
That way is...

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:37.050
He's headed toward the village!

00:09:37.280 --> 00:09:39.220
Hey! We're running away! Go faster!

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:51.610
Lady Sara!

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:53.360
It's a flight of wyverns!

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:56.780
Why have wyverns come to a place like this?

00:09:57.380 --> 00:10:00.860
Could it be the egg that boy has?

00:10:02.930 --> 00:10:05.110
We can't allow him to enter the village!

00:10:05.110 --> 00:10:06.950
Orphia! Alma!

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:09.330
We'll handle the black wyvern.

00:10:09.550 --> 00:10:11.580
Uzuma and the rest of you,
take the other wyverns!

00:10:11.580 --> 00:10:12.790
Understood!

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:15.240
Take word to Mistress Ursula and the others!

00:10:15.240 --> 00:10:15.980
Understood!

00:10:26.380 --> 00:10:29.920
Now, then, as his role is over...

00:10:30.410 --> 00:10:32.060
Farewell.

00:10:37.260 --> 00:10:40.640
Alma, please take care of the black wyvern.

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:41.550
Understood!

00:10:41.550 --> 00:10:45.200
Big Sister Sara, will you 
lend me your bond spirit?

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:48.270
I'll have it fight alongside my Ifritah!

00:10:48.270 --> 00:10:49.480
All right.

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:51.100
Hel!

00:11:02.400 --> 00:11:04.910
I'm... going to leave the village.

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:06.550
No.

00:11:06.550 --> 00:11:08.290
I can't take you with me.

00:11:08.290 --> 00:11:11.290
No, I don't want that. I don't want it! No!

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:19.440
A-Are you all right?

00:11:22.600 --> 00:11:24.140
What's going on?

00:11:29.480 --> 00:11:30.640
An egg?

00:11:48.860 --> 00:11:50.500
Quickly, evacuate! Take shelter!

00:11:50.500 --> 00:11:51.770
Please, hurry!

00:11:52.570 --> 00:11:54.140
Has something happened?

00:11:54.140 --> 00:11:56.690
Oh, Rio. The festival has been canceled.

00:11:56.690 --> 00:11:57.730
Canceled?

00:11:57.970 --> 00:12:00.240
A flight of wyverns is approaching.

00:12:00.690 --> 00:12:01.990
Wyverns?

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:05.970
It seems like Sara and the others are 
holding them off above the forest for now,

00:12:05.970 --> 00:12:07.910
but they may soon be upon us.

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:08.980
The forest?

00:12:08.980 --> 00:12:10.160
Onii-chan!

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:12.100
Latifa!

00:12:24.330 --> 00:12:25.250
No!

00:12:25.250 --> 00:12:26.240
Latifa!

00:12:33.350 --> 00:12:34.700
Big Sis Alma!

00:12:34.700 --> 00:12:36.050
Why are you here?

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:41.820
Ifritah!

00:12:43.500 --> 00:12:45.820
Latifa, please stay back!

00:13:05.420 --> 00:13:06.970
Big Sis Alma!

00:13:07.330 --> 00:13:09.290
You can't beat it! Let's run away!

00:13:10.110 --> 00:13:11.200
I can't!

00:13:11.200 --> 00:13:13.770
At this rate, the wyverns 
will reach the village!

00:13:14.610 --> 00:13:15.940
The village?

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:25.260
If I can buy some time...

00:13:25.260 --> 00:13:26.670
Over here!

00:13:26.670 --> 00:13:27.890
This way!

00:13:27.890 --> 00:13:30.100
Latifa! Don't!

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:35.230
I'm a part of the village, too!

00:13:35.230 --> 00:13:36.380
Latifa!

00:13:36.380 --> 00:13:38.430
Come on! I'm over here!

00:13:38.430 --> 00:13:42.380
Latifa, just buy a little time!

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:44.450
We'll switch places on my command!

00:13:44.450 --> 00:13:45.550
Right!

00:13:56.890 --> 00:13:58.140
Latifa!

00:14:05.840 --> 00:14:07.200
Onii-chan!

00:14:07.440 --> 00:14:09.610
I'm sorry I took so long, Latifa.

00:14:12.820 --> 00:14:14.170
I-It's fine!

00:14:14.170 --> 00:14:17.410
I'm the one who's sorry, 
since I ran off like that...

00:14:17.860 --> 00:14:19.050
We can talk later.

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:21.980
Everything's fine now. You can stand down.

00:14:34.860 --> 00:14:37.600
He's battling a black wyvern
 with his bare hands?

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:41.270
Onii-chan!

00:15:12.310 --> 00:15:13.990
I-Incredible!

00:15:13.990 --> 00:15:17.420
He defeated that black wyvern so easily!

00:15:18.570 --> 00:15:21.130
It seems the inside of its 
mouth was a weak spot.

00:15:28.020 --> 00:15:30.030
Master Rio? And Latifa, too?

00:15:30.030 --> 00:15:34.230
That's amazing, Alma! 
You defeated the black wyvern?

00:15:34.230 --> 00:15:38.290
No, it was Master Rio who 
defeated it single-handedly.

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:39.470
Single-handedly?

00:15:40.660 --> 00:15:41.720
Are there wounded?

00:15:41.720 --> 00:15:44.490
Fortunately, we took care of 
things without a single casualty.

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:48.280
I wonder why the other wyverns retreated.

00:15:48.780 --> 00:15:51.760
It must be because this 
black wyvern was defeated.

00:15:52.040 --> 00:15:57.850
Wyverns are timid by nature. They won't 
challenge those they know they can't beat.

00:15:57.850 --> 00:15:59.770
This is all thanks to Master Rio!

00:16:00.540 --> 00:16:02.180
Thank you so much!

00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:03.520
I am...

00:16:04.280 --> 00:16:06.160
your sworn friend, after all.

00:16:06.530 --> 00:16:08.040
Onii-chan!

00:16:10.700 --> 00:16:13.530
I'm... sorry about last night.

00:16:13.530 --> 00:16:16.080
No, it's my fault.

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:18.980
There must have been a better 
way for me to tell you.

00:16:19.540 --> 00:16:22.350
The truth is... I already knew.

00:16:23.040 --> 00:16:27.540
I knew you might leave 
one day, Onii-chan.

00:16:28.350 --> 00:16:30.810
I was... really scared.

00:16:30.810 --> 00:16:32.050
Scared?

00:16:32.270 --> 00:16:36.940
Because I've only ever caused 
trouble for you, Onii-chan.

00:16:36.940 --> 00:16:40.130
I thought that's why you might leave one day.

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:43.010
I wondered if I was a hindrance to you.

00:16:43.460 --> 00:16:45.310
You're not troublesome or a hindrance to me.

00:16:47.080 --> 00:16:50.190
You're my little sister, right, Latifa?

00:16:51.070 --> 00:16:53.370
Onii-chan... are you sure?

00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:58.420
You really don't mind having 
a little sister like me?

00:16:58.420 --> 00:16:59.550
I...

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:04.120
I really want to be your 
little sister, Onii-chan!

00:17:04.430 --> 00:17:06.540
You're the person who saved me,

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:09.600
who treated me so kindly... 
I want to be your little sister!

00:17:10.830 --> 00:17:14.130
It's only that I didn't want to kill anyone.

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:16.860
I didn't want to dirty my hands.

00:17:16.860 --> 00:17:18.090
You're wrong!

00:17:18.340 --> 00:17:19.710
It's real!

00:17:19.710 --> 00:17:22.600
Onii-chan, your kindness is real!

00:17:23.420 --> 00:17:24.400
Thank you.

00:17:25.370 --> 00:17:26.060
You know...

00:17:26.730 --> 00:17:28.980
If you really hate it that much, Latifa...

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:30.610
No, it's fine!

00:17:30.970 --> 00:17:32.610
I'll work hard.

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:34.700
And I'm sure we'll meet again someday.

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:38.620
I'm heading east...

00:17:38.970 --> 00:17:42.560
toward the Yagumo region,
but I never told you why, did I?

00:17:42.560 --> 00:17:43.380
No.

00:17:44.030 --> 00:17:46.280
It's the land my late parents came from.

00:17:46.810 --> 00:17:48.860
That's why I want to try going there.

00:17:48.860 --> 00:17:52.840
This is the first time you've told me 
anything about yourself, Onii-chan.

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:54.880
I guess it is.

00:17:55.230 --> 00:17:58.800
There's something I want to tell you, too.

00:18:00.530 --> 00:18:03.640
I don't know if you'll believe me, but...

00:18:03.950 --> 00:18:09.060
The thing is, I died once. 
And I used to be human.

00:18:09.370 --> 00:18:12.820
I was reincarnated and 
became the person I am now.

00:18:14.540 --> 00:18:17.070
I was in a place called Japan before.

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:18.140
I see.

00:18:18.520 --> 00:18:20.270
You believe me?

00:18:20.650 --> 00:18:23.540
I do. Because I'm the same.

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:24.520
What?

00:18:24.940 --> 00:18:28.040
I was a Japanese person 
just like you, Latifa.

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:29.540
What?

00:18:30.590 --> 00:18:34.930
Actually, it might have been better 
if I'd confided in you before.

00:18:35.630 --> 00:18:39.820
It's just that, in the beginning, 
your mental state wasn't very stable,

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:41.810
so I thought it better not to tell you.

00:18:42.640 --> 00:18:46.790
No. The truth is, I didn't 
want to say anything.

00:18:47.420 --> 00:18:51.670
I felt like it would raise lingering 
regrets from when I was Japanese.

00:18:52.090 --> 00:18:53.150
I see.

00:18:53.750 --> 00:18:57.390
Onii-chan was Japanese, just like me.

00:18:59.630 --> 00:19:02.060
Did those regrets appear?

00:19:03.610 --> 00:19:06.410
If I said "no," I'd be lying.

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:11.540
But I swore that I would be 
strong and survive this world.

00:19:11.540 --> 00:19:15.240
That's another reason I want 
to go to Yagumo at least once.

00:19:15.240 --> 00:19:17.920
Yes. I'll get stronger, too!

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:20.930
I'll be here waiting for you 
to come home, Onii-chan!

00:19:21.460 --> 00:19:22.930
Thank you...

00:19:23.150 --> 00:19:24.170
Latifa.

00:19:31.840 --> 00:19:33.340
Thank you for everything.

00:19:33.810 --> 00:19:35.940
I never imagined you would do 
me the honor of seeing me off.

00:19:35.940 --> 00:19:39.200
Quit talking like we're strangers!

00:19:39.200 --> 00:19:41.820
This is from us dwarfs.

00:19:42.460 --> 00:19:44.420
The sword is made of mithril,

00:19:44.420 --> 00:19:48.830
so it can absorb your spirit arts 
and cloak itself in them.

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:53.790
The armor is made from the hide 
of the black wyvern you defeated.

00:19:54.110 --> 00:19:59.130
Its defensive strength will make you think 
metal armor is no better than paper.

00:19:59.580 --> 00:20:01.140
Thank you very much.

00:20:01.140 --> 00:20:03.640
From the elves, there are secret 
medicines and wondrous elixirs.

00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:06.600
From the beast peoples, foodstuffs and drink.

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:09.600
With so much, carrying it all 
with me will be a little...

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:11.600
Sir Rio, please take this.

00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:14.590
Is that... a space-time cache?

00:20:15.340 --> 00:20:17.980
I couldn't possibly accept 
something so precious!

00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:19.860
It is proof that you are a sworn friend.

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:22.940
With this, your travels should 
be considerably easier.

00:20:22.940 --> 00:20:24.910
It's fine! Please, take it!

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:27.870
Thank you very much.

00:20:27.870 --> 00:20:31.620
Go ahead and put your baggage 
in the space-time cache.

00:20:32.990 --> 00:20:34.090
Storage!

00:20:42.740 --> 00:20:46.800
If the unthinkable happens, and this 
village of the spirits faces danger,

00:20:46.800 --> 00:20:49.630
as your sworn friend, 
I promise I will come running.

00:20:50.940 --> 00:20:53.690
Onii-chan, have a good trip!

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:55.690
I'll be back.

00:20:55.690 --> 00:20:57.250
Thank you for everything you did for me!

00:20:57.250 --> 00:20:58.430
It is we who thank you!

00:20:58.430 --> 00:20:59.660
Safe travels.

00:20:59.660 --> 00:21:00.760
Take care.

00:21:02.010 --> 00:21:05.950
Take care of Latifa... of my little sister.

00:21:06.380 --> 00:21:07.860
Leave it to us!

00:21:09.260 --> 00:21:11.290
See you later, Onii-chan!

00:21:16.840 --> 00:21:17.880
Then...

00:21:22.340 --> 00:21:24.070
Have a good trip!

00:21:24.070 --> 00:21:26.180
Onii-chan, stay safe!

00:21:26.590 --> 00:21:29.280
Stay... safe...

00:23:08.930 --> 00:23:10.490
Hup!

00:23:20.380 --> 00:23:23.340
No other letters have come since then.

00:23:25.020 --> 00:23:28.540
Are you okay, Rio?

